    "title": "邀请客户访问云店&关联云店客户与智慧记AI进销存客户",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97\" tabindex=\"-1\">邀请客户访问云店<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>云店-我的云店，右下角可扫描邀请客户进店，可截图保存发生给想邀请的客户。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202405/34ee7fb0d7fa9327f119d0af1a2d812e.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E5%92%8C%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E8%AE%B0ai%E8%BF%9B%E9%94%80%E5%AD%98%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7\" tabindex=\"-1\">关联云店客户和智慧记AI进销存客户<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E5%92%8C%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E8%AE%B0ai%E8%BF%9B%E9%94%80%E5%AD%98%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>在智慧记AI进销存首页，客户模块，点击客户详情，也可以实现邀请客户，这样就可以实现关联云店客户和智慧记AI进销存客户</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202405/12d458685936ab76f16c3627ea8d1f12.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
